To generate Assets.car and app.icns use chromium/tools/mac/icons/compile_car.py
This will automatically generate and copy them to the folder containing Assets.xcassets

Running in this directory:
  python3 ../../../chromium/tools/mac/icons/compile_car.py vivaldi_final/mac/Assets.xcassets

Replace "vivaldi_final" with "vivaldi_sopranos"/"vivaldi_snapshot" as appropriate.
